      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 5:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Thus all the work that Solomon made for the house of the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.5.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.5.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "LORD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "2CH.5.1",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "2CH.5.1"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "was finished: and Solomon brought in",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.5.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.5.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "all",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "2CH.5.1",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "2CH.5.1"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "the things that David his father had dedicated; and the silver, and the gold, and all the instruments, put he among the treasures of the house of God.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.5.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.5.1"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 5:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "¶ Then Solomon assembled the elders of Israel, and all the heads of the tribes, the chief of the fathers of the children of Israel, unto Jerusalem, to bring up the ark of the covenant of the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.5.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.5.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "LORD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "2CH.5.2",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "2CH.5.2"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "out of the city of David, which",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.5.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.5.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "is",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "2CH.5.2",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "2CH.5.2"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Zion.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.5.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.5.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 5:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wherefore all the men of Israel assembled themselves unto the king in the feast which",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.5.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.5.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "was",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "2CH.5.3",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "2CH.5.3"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "in the seventh month.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.5.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.5.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 5:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And all the elders of Israel came; and the Levites took up the ark.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.5.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.5.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 5:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And they brought up the ark, and the tabernacle of the congregation, and all the holy vessels that",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.5.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.5.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "were",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "2CH.5.5",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "2CH.5.5"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "in the tabernacle, these did the priests",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.5.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.5.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "and",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "2CH.5.5",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "2CH.5.5"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "the Levites bring up.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.5.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.5.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 5:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Also king Solomon, and all the congregation of Israel that were assembled unto him before the ark, sacrificed sheep and oxen, which could not be told nor numbered for multitude.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.5.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.5.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 5:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And the priests brought in the ark of the covenant of the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.5.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.5.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "LORD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "2CH.5.7",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "2CH.5.7"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "unto his place, to the oracle of the house, into the most holy",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.5.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.5.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "place, even",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "2CH.5.7",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "2CH.5.7"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "under the wings of the cherubims:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.5.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.5.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 5:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "For the cherubims spread forth",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.5.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.5.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "their",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "2CH.5.8",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "2CH.5.8"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "wings over the place of the ark, and the cherubims covered the ark and the staves thereof above.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.5.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.5.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 5:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And they drew out the staves",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.5.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.5.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "of the ark",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "2CH.5.9",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "2CH.5.9"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ", that the ends of the staves were seen from the ark before the oracle; but they were not seen without. And there it is unto this day.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.5.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.5.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.5.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.5.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 5:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "There was",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "2CH.5.10",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "2CH.5.10"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nothing in the ark save the two tables which Moses put",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.5.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.5.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "therein",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "2CH.5.10",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "2CH.5.10"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "at Horeb, when the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.5.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.5.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "LORD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "2CH.5.10",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "2CH.5.10"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "made",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.5.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.5.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "a covenant",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "2CH.5.10",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "2CH.5.10"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "with the children of Israel, when they came out of Egypt.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.5.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.5.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 5:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "¶ And it came to pass, when the priests were come out of the holy",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.5.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.5.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "place:",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "2CH.5.11",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "2CH.5.11"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "(for all the priests",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.5.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.5.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "that were",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "2CH.5.11",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "2CH.5.11"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "present were sanctified,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.5.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.5.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "and",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "2CH.5.11",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "2CH.5.11"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "did not",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.5.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.5.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "then",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "2CH.5.11",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "2CH.5.11"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "wait by course:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.5.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.5.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.5.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.5.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 5:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Also the Levites",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.5.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.5.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "which were",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "2CH.5.12",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "2CH.5.12"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "the singers, all of them of Asaph, of Heman, of Jeduthun, with their sons and their brethren,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.5.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.5.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "being",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "2CH.5.12",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "2CH.5.12"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "arrayed in white linen, having cymbals and psalteries and harps, stood at the east end of the altar, and with them an hundred and twenty priests sounding with trumpets:)",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.5.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.5.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 5:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "It came even to pass, as the trumpeters and singers",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.5.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.5.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "were",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "2CH.5.13",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "2CH.5.13"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "as one, to make one sound to be heard in praising and thanking the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.5.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.5.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "LORD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "2CH.5.13",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "2CH.5.13"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "; and when they lifted up",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.5.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.5.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "their",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
